cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Prompt Injection Eval"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cavaletto
    given-names: Federico
repository-code: "https://github.com/fcavaletto/prompt-injection-eval"
url: "https://fcavaletto.github.io/prompt-injection-eval/"
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-10-05
abstract: >-
  A small local evaluation harness for indirect prompt injection in open-weight
  language models. Version 0.2.0 publishes a two-model study of a baseline
  prompt, a generic document-trust defense, and a datamarking defense, scored
  with deterministic rules and a human review of those rules. It is a
  diagnostic, not a production safety guarantee.
keywords:
  - prompt injection
  - language models
  - evaluation
  - ai safety
